* CABSRT03 - SORT FOR THE USAGE TYPE SPLIT
* SORTS TELCABS.CABS.USAGE.DATEVAL BY OCN/BAN/CIRCUIT/USOC SO
* CABING05 CAN SPLIT VOICE/DATA/SPECIAL WITHOUT A GROUP BREAK
* IN THE MIDDLE OF A CIRCUIT'S RECORDS.
*
* THE SUM FIELDS BELOW SUMMARISES CONVERSATION MINUTES ACROSS
* DUPLICATE KEYS (SAME OCN/BAN/CIRCUIT/USOC/CYCLE-DATE) BEFORE
* THE SPLIT RUNS.  THIS IS THE ESTATE'S ONLY DEDUPLICATION-BY-
* SUMMING RULE - CABING03 ONLY CATCHES EXACT DUPLICATE SEQUENCE
* NUMBERS, NOT TWO DIFFERENT CDRS FOR THE SAME USAGE WINDOW.
* THIS SORT IS THE ONLY PLACE THOSE GET COLLAPSED INTO ONE
* RECORD.  NO CABING PROGRAM KNOWS THIS HAPPENED.
 SORT FIELDS=(5,4,CH,A,9,13,CH,A,60,10,CH,A,70,5,CH,A)
 SUM FIELDS=(120,7,PD)
 OPTION EQUALS
 RECORD TYPE=F,LENGTH=200
